Have you done all these changes within a cds object? (You’ll have to make a new cds with the gene activity matrix in the expression slot)

Are you still saying “SYMBOL” or “ALIAS” as your cds_gene_id_type?

If you’ve done the above, can you check that a few of these genes are indeed in your dataset? You can use

AnnotationDbi::mapIds(org.Hs.eg.db, keys= “ENSG00000196154”, column=“ALIAS”, “ENSEMBL”)

etc, and then check if the output is in your row names.

